-- City sweep group 18 (High Desert & Mountains), 2026-10-25 run.
-- Sources: SB County Parks Calico Ghost Haunt 2026 page; NBC LA (SkyPark 2026 holiday season Nov 10–Jan 10);
-- Z107.7 FM / visit29.org (29 Palms Holiday Festival, Yucca Valley tree lighting & light parade); SB County District 1 holiday roundups
-- (Barstow tree lighting, Apple Valley Christmas in the Village); Barstow College event page; Alpine Mountaineer (Goodwin's Crestline Family Christmas).
-- Geocoding services were unreachable from this run: Calico and SkyPark reuse existing verified venue coordinates;
-- the rest are venue-level estimates from the street address/intersection (not city centers) and should be spot-checked.
ON CONFLICT(id) DO UPDATE SET name=excluded.name, county=excluded.county, city=excluded.city, type=excluded.type, start_date=excluded.start_date, end_date=excluded.end_date, status=excluded.status, free=excluded.free, price=excluded.price, hours=excluded.hours, lat=excluded.lat, lng=excluded.lng, blurb=excluded.blurb, url=excluded.url, season=excluded.season, venue=excluded.venue, address=excluded.address, updated_at=datetime('now');
